Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Redwood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,musk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.35,0:00:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,let's start, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up so don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stop beating, don't stop beating,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.10,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Sports Maximum, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,On Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,much akin to how the ratio of water\Nto land is seven parts to three,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.22,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The souls of living things\Nhave a perfect set amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crucial to maintain\Nthe balance of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As the population of Earth increases,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't be a mistake to assume that\Nin accordance with that rising number,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the same amount of living\Ncreatures are in decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that the number of souls\Nthat exist in full is a fixed constant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But let me posit a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What if one person were able\Nto possess several more,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,or perhaps even thousands\Nmore souls simultaneously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Continuously, what do you think\Nsuch a person has the power to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What will that person's future hold,\Nand how soon will it come to pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have absolutely no idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's definitely a fascinating\Nconcept to imagine coming true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, what is it you\Nwant me to do exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Sports Maximum, my request to you\Nhas to do with this specific bone I hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to use your power to\Nattempt to modify the state of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can take\Nthis bone and resurrect it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it from a human body?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That is irrelevant to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I took possession\Nof it from an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's just one single piece\Nof a far more complex hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I resurrect that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you have a stockpile of all\Nhis other assorted bones somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible to resurrect\Nsomething from just one bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Geo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the one bone of his that remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest became dust and scattered like\Nashes on the wind, no longer of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You must do this for me, Sports Maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're incapable of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,well then, I'll be forced to take back\Nin full the power I gave you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, because\NI've already done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I've already finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this? The bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking right now! Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do with the bone, fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you where his bone went.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You best answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, are we sure it's really Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control it with my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bizarre to imagine it would\Nmove around on its own, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can actually feel it moving\Nwithin the walls of this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Start looking right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Sports Maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This can only mean that\NI was right all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that the way to heaven he kept tantalizing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,me with does in fact exist and this proves
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it the search will\Ncontinue but let's suspend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it for now it's quite\Nobvious we must let it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,decide its own course\Ni'll observe it first
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then combine it with\NJotaro Kujo's memories for
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone to find out\Nthe real truth once and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,for all i can feel the\Nbones presence at the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,maximum security\Ndisciplinary wing right as
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.64,0:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we speak it seems\Nsomeone might have picked
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it up though what you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,saw were sports maximum's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,memories that aramis found by chance of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,course jolene's seen\Nthis too what did jolene
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,make it so she can go\Nto the discipline cell
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,just to find that same\Nbone belonging to Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's way too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pale Snake is definitely going to do\Nhis best to take out Jolene for good,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,especially now that Sports\NMaximum's memories were discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jolene stays there by\Nherself, she's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason I'm alive\Nright now is Jolene, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I have no idea\Nwhat I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way you can help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Weather Forecast, who's\Nrecovering in the medical wing now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't be able to go over there either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to be helpful\Nin some way, too, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The isolated strict discipline\Ncell in the maximum security
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,disciplinary wing is on the\Nsoutheast side of the men's wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To get there, you have to get on\Nthe prisoner transport vehicle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,so there's no shortcut or bypass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even been there,\Ndespite knowing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't protect Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all I want to do,\Nbut I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need from you is to take me\Nto that building on the down low.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Crisscross, are you available to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't rely on him. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a stand user, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, were you born with\Nthis power or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you see it's like i told you anastasia's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,not worth it that guy\Nwill never cooperate no
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,matter what how come it's because i'll do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,anything if you'll help\Nus if you get me to the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,discipline cell building\Ni swear i'll make it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,worth your while what do\Nyou say buddy how about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it stop ff just let it\Ngo both kindness and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,generosity just aren't\Npart of his personality
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, um, wait, so you haven't\Nheard of the name Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a cold-blooded murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, his full name\Nis Narciso Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know what might have triggered\Nit, but since he was a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.44,0:07:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,he's had one bizarre habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not so much a\Nhabit as it is a syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,One that compels him to take\Neverything he touches apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's seemingly no limit\Nto what'll dismantle either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When he was 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he took apart a neighbor's Porsche, and\Nhe was in the hospital for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even taken apart a\Nhigh-voltage telephone pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And one time, when he was 21,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,he went to visit his then-girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,showing up unannounced late\Nthat night at her apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When he opened the door, he found\Nher in bed with another man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he wanted to ensure they'd\Nnever be together again
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.06,0:08:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so he separated them into\Ndozens of irreparable
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,pieces he was arrested and went through a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,psychiatric evaluation\Nthe results were normal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's why he ended\Nup here at the aquarium
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no telling what\Nhe would do if weather
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,forecast wasn't holding\Nhim down for safety's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,sake that's who he really\Nis So please forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to get to Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll never make it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.78,0:09:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I need reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if I could ask for a\Nperfect backup, it'd be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.78,0:09:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If asking nicely won't work, I'll\Nlet my FF bullets do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty persuasive. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As it stands, though, there's a pretty\Ngood chance my first shot will go way wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where am I even supposed to aim?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go in like it's the kill shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he won't even\Nacknowledge me, much less obey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unnerving, but I have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the whole reason why I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want, I'll\Nprotect Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, as you say, cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Also if she's looking for that bone or.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever it is that seems\Nto be in such demand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,then i'll help find that too we have to go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:09:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,she might be getting\Nattacked even as we speak
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,right now wait anastasia
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you scheming
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to do me scheming no it's just as i said
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect her with every power I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But, but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I've come to like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything about her from my first view.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, I respect her resolve to go\Nto the discipline cell for her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's quite admirable,\Nto say the very least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep her safe through this,\Nthen I plan on making her my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're FF, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'll do anything,\Ndidn't you? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then give us your blessing\Nno marriage is official
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.28,0:10:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Without one, huh? Did uh,\Ndid he just say what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,he said am I going insane\Nhere he wants to marry Jolene
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Putzai, you sent off a bomb\Nand there, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's in the wall, with a time delay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's Anastasia's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.42,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And he has the power of Diver Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us your blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just out of curiosity, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of all the ones\Nyou've ever come across,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,what was the weakest stand power?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.02,0:12:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter whether it's one that\Nyou happen to find anywhere in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,or one that you newly manifested.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For any pursuit in life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,people should find an occupation that\Nbest fits their true personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.98,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A king would feel like a king, and\Na chef would feel like a chef, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to live truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The same goes for Stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength and weakness do not apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I phrased that badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant it more like when little kids\Ndebate about who'd win in a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,say Stallone or Van Damme.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, the stand I\Nnamed Survivor is the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beyond control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Survivor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The name sounds strong, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the year 1982.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.22,0:13:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Lorraine region of France, a\Ngroup of six hikers met with disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,all six of them perished\Nhorribly after the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,recon team examined the\Narea where the tragedy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,occurred they found\Nevidence of brutal combat
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,they had all fought literally to the death
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,they had attacked one\Nanother with so much force
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,their bones shattered\Ninstantly upon contact
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,a tooth that had broken off after being
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,struck was found half\Nburied in a nearby rock
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage was so horrific,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,even the so-called\Nwinner was hurt too badly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to descend and died of his wounds as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As I found out later,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,those people had stayed at\Na mountain hut the night
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,before and had an altercation\Nwith the owner of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the women there\Ncrudely insulted the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, she told him\Nhis body odor was vile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it safe to assume the owner\Nof the hut was the stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:13:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But what did the owner do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it that compelled those people\Nto fight each other to the death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing externally at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But deep in the recesses of his brain,\Nanger was slowly beginning to brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Before much longer, that anger evolved\Nenough to become a weak electric signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This signal then descended\Nthrough his entire
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,nervous system and flowed into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The electric signal traveled\Nalong the surface of the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,directly toward the six people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,For the ground ensues to better conduct\Nelectricity, the ground needs to be wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The electrical power a\Nnerve carries at any given
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,time measures a mere seven\Nhundredths of a volt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how little power that stand has.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Survivor's attacks make one feel\Nnothing, and it does nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Its effects don't come close to things like\Nseverely injuring or controlling people,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,nor weakening them, or\Neven knocking them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't inflict one external action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All it does is make them mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It awakens combative instinct in the\Nlimbic system of people's brains,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,just a little at first,\Nand then it proliferates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because one woman said he smelled bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he drove the entire group\Ninto a bloody brawl,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,one that ended in carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,earlier you said it was beyond anyone's\Ncontrol right yes it's an unusable stand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it can't distinguish between enemies and\Nallies if there's infighting among your
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,subordinates your organization falls
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,apart so then may i have that if you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,need it just the stand Are you going to\Nremove the power and keep it as a disk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if so, that just might work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The exact right person, at the\Nexact right place and moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That time might be nigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, these mushrooms\Nmight be okay to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.94,0:16:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,F.E.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,40536, it's time for your shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Up and at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes! Ha! I told you! She\Ndid it! Look at that! She hid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She scurried under that\Nbed like a cockroach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I win for this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be $20, a deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay up, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All I got on me right\Nnow is fifteen dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a discount?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry, Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, now I just have to feel around\Nwith my thread and hope I find the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of bone is it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:16:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I know it's somewhere\Nin this discipline cell building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone in here has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get my hands on it first, that\Ncreepy palesnake will soon follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,there's my father's stolen memory disc\Nthat the bastard is still holding on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, park it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you to stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's the overrun on some\Ndrama at the Marlins game tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not holding my breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The starting pitcher and the on-field\Nbroadcaster lady just broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be off his game tonight for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you the $15 from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.30,0:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, do you even have the cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get yanked in the first inning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Three up, three down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.23,0:17:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you excited for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This valve gets a little sticky sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing else to change into\Nunless I go back to the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I splashed\Nyou on purpose, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.89,0:18:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could\Nhave hit you that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Back the fuck off, Westwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, pay back the bitch, licker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine, I give.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I give, I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:18:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:18:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have a change of\Nclothes, I'll lend you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that gonna be okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's stop this shit already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Westwood, I've never seen you this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did someone put\Nhot sauce in your shorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, little buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to you, old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You pack a good punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the actual hell is\Nwrong with these assholes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm getting excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What definition, what sparkling vigor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see every point of\Npower in that ripped lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single muscle is\Na gorgeous work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful, and I can tap right\Ninto where all his strengths are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the raw beauty of\Nbattle, and I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this just got even weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with their backs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Those things that look like\Nflashlights or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just FYI.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to reduce you\Nto a stain on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a golden god!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this actually a Stand attack, is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that guard the enemy no the enemy hasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,revealed itself yet but this is a stand i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,know it is this abnormality\Nis a stand attack
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,do not give what is holy to\Nthe dogs lest they trample them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,under their feet and turn and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,tear you in pieces matthew 76
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:21:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,regrettably sports maximum is\Nmissing i don't know how or
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,why they were able to find out\Nbut there is no doubt they've
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,read through maximum's memories\Nand this is a rather large
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,problem to fix this i've sent\Nfour stan users to the discipline
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.34,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,cell building however if
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,jolene cujo has found her way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,to the discipline cell in\Npursuit of Deo's priceless bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.38,0:21:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow her to live anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.82,0:21:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will make sure it's done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how it happens as long as\Nit's in the disciplined cell building.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those four people will do\Nanything and everything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to ensure the total eradication\Nof Jotaro's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is riding on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, is he letting them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:22:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your point of\Npower in all of you! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see where your\Nstrengths lie from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.20,0:22:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your most dominant muscle\Ngroups and their glorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Fight Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,of some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
